Legend:
- afdoltob 1st itr: ratio of afdob/afdoltob time for the first iteration.
- afdob/afdoltob: ratio of afdob/afdoltob time. Higher is better for afdoltob. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- afdolto 1st itr: ratio of afdob/afdolto time for the first iteration.
- afdob/afdolto: ratio of afdob/afdolto time. Higher is better for afdolto. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- afdo 1st itr: ratio of afdob/afdo time for the first iteration.
- afdob/afdo: ratio of afdob/afdo time. Higher is better for afdo. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- pgob 1st itr: ratio of afdob/pgob time for the first iteration.
- afdob/pgob: ratio of afdob/pgob time. Higher is better for pgob. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- pgoltob 1st itr: ratio of afdob/pgoltob time for the first iteration.
