- pgo 1st itr: ratio of afdob/pgo time for the first iteration.
- afdob/pgo: ratio of afdob/pgo time. Higher is better for pgo. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- base 1st itr: ratio of afdob/base time for the first iteration.
- afdob/base: ratio of afdob/base time. Higher is better for base. Above 1 represents a speedup.
- ***: p < 0.001, **: p < 0.01, *: p < 0.05 (Welch's t-test)

